      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do not understand,\nThis IS the values from the version configuration JSON\nThe values `EVSSIM_GUEST_TESTS_GUEST_VM_IMAGE`, `EVSSIM_KERNEL_COMPILE_CONTAINER`, `EVSSIM_QEMU_COMPILE_CONTAINER`, and etc\u0027 are variables that are defined by `load_config.sh` from `configs.json`",
